<title>HONG KONG: Lee &amp; Man Holdings debuts at HK$1.20/shr.</title>
<headline>Lee &amp; Man Holdings debuts at HK$1.20/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Lee &amp; Man Holdings Ltd, a handbag and paper products maker, made their trading debut on Wednesday at HK$1.20 per share, compared with their issue price of HK$1.00.</p>
</text>
